<title>USA: Browning-Ferris to sell operations.</title>
<headline>Browning-Ferris to sell operations.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Browning-Ferris Industries Inc said Tuesday that certain of its subsidiaries have agreed to sell operations located in Pennsylvania, Ohio and Wisconsin to Superior Service Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Browning-Ferris said collection, recycling, landfill and transfer station operations are included in the sale.</p>
<p>The company said these businesses generated revenues of $33 million in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Browning-Ferris said the transaction is for cash and is expected to be completed later this month.</p>
</text>
